{"version":1,"content":"<p>由3位母親支嚳儀（Venus）、賴慰玲（Winki）及陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne），以真人騷形式主持的親子旅遊節目《玩住學‧學住玩》。</p><p>3位靚媽心口掛「勇」字，帶孩子探索世界走出舒適圈，讓小朋友憑獨立思考解決難題。</p><p>她們走訪雲南西雙版納、馬來西亞沙巴及尼泊爾，見證文化差異，發掘獨特人物及風景。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T13:19:39.861213+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T12:33:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T02:37:38.289304+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:17:41.178247+00:00","content_hash":"d213850a4cd5cc5865949e75e93c91796ef34d6d7f952d2fc9a9388c2d1ecfa5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}